{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00736",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.23,
      "end_seconds": 14.91,
      "duration_seconds": 12.68,
      "text": "Good morning. Let me be precise: I have a painful bump on the side of my right big toe, which is worse in shoes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.6,
      "end_seconds": 23.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Thank you. How long has it been there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.56,
      "end_seconds": 36.25,
      "duration_seconds": 9.69,
      "text": "The bump, about three years. The pain, the last four months, since I started a job on my feet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.09,
      "end_seconds": 43.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "What sort of pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.84,
      "end_seconds": 56.51,
      "duration_seconds": 10.67,
      "text": "Sharp, rubbing, and a throb by the end of the day. And the skin over it is red and sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.51,
      "end_seconds": 63.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "What shoes make it worse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.53,
      "end_seconds": 72.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Anything narrow. Work shoes, and heels. In trainers, it's bearable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.4,
      "end_seconds": 80.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Any numbness, tingling, or burning in the toe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.38,
      "end_seconds": 85.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No numbness. No tingling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.9,
      "end_seconds": 95.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "Any swelling of the whole toe, or heat, or discharge from the skin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.2,
      "end_seconds": 106.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "No, nothing like that. Just the bump, and the redness around it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.03,
      "end_seconds": 118.39,
      "duration_seconds": 8.36,
      "text": "Let me ask you to take your shoe and sock off, and I'll have a look. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.78,
      "end_seconds": 139.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.6,
      "end_seconds": 159.51,
      "duration_seconds": 16.91,
      "text": "There's a bony prominence at the base of the toe, and the toe is angled inwards, which is a bunion, and the skin over it is pink where the shoe rubs. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.97,
      "end_seconds": 165.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "I thought so. Is it genetic? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.13,
      "end_seconds": 175.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "text": "Partly, yes. Narrow shoes make it worse, but they're not the cause. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.29,
      "end_seconds": 181.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Will I need surgery? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.68,
      "end_seconds": 197.6,
      "duration_seconds": 12.92,
      "text": "Not necessarily. Surgery is only for pain that doesn't respond to other measures, and it takes months to recover from. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.2,
      "end_seconds": 204.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "I'd rather avoid that. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.24,
      "end_seconds": 217.54,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "Most people do. First, wider shoes with a deeper toe box, soft insoles, and a gel pad over the bump."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.53,
      "end_seconds": 224.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Where do I get those? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.6,
      "end_seconds": 235.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "Any pharmacy, and a good shoe shop will fit them for you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.15,
      "end_seconds": 240.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "And the heels? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.39,
      "end_seconds": 247.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Keep them for special occasions only."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.51,
      "end_seconds": 253.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "That's fair. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.4,
      "end_seconds": 266.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "Ice it for ten minutes after a long day, and keep your toes moving. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.66,
      "end_seconds": 271.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.27,
      "end_seconds": 290.27,
      "duration_seconds": 16.0,
      "text": "If it's still bothering you after two months of that, or the toe gets red and hot, or the skin breaks, come back and I'll refer you to the foot specialist."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.05,
      "end_seconds": 297.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I'll do that. Thank you, doctor. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.9,
      "end_seconds": 305.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Good luck with the new shoes. ~"
    }
  ]
}
